      "profile": "SP-10",
      "question": "Someone pasted me the start of the wall tools list from the docs (below), but it stops after Mitre. In my new project I drew one exterior wall as two segments lying in a straight line, and I want them to be a single wall instead. Is there one of those tools for that, and how do I use it?",
      "reference": {
        "answer": {
          "support": ["C1.Q1", "C2.Q1", "C1.Q2", "C1.Q3"],
          "text": "Yes: the same list continues with Merge (SHIFT + M), which combines two wall segments into a single wall. With the wall tool active, select the two wall segments, then press SHIFT + M or select the tool from the top bar."
        },
        "assumptions": ["blender", "bonsai", "model_state"],
        "hazard": null,
        "scope_note": null,
        "steps": [
          {
            "support": ["C2.Q1"],
            "text": "Activate the wall tool from the toolbar."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q2"],
            "text": "Select the two wall segments you want to modify."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q1", "C1.Q3"],
            "text": "Press SHIFT + M for Merge, which combines two wall segments into a single wall, or select the tool from the top bar."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q4"],
            "text": "Follow the on-screen prompts or adjust parameters as needed."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [
          {"display": "Wall Tool", "kind": "bonsai_tool", "value": "bim.wall_tool"}
        ]
      },
      "review": {"decided_on": "2026-11-22", "decision_id": "GP-004.02", "packet_id": "GP-004", "reviewed_draft_sha256": "3a305e8d3537285b224289bde4088a9ffa437236f57409d03806bdb058336297", "setup_sha256": "26f82c3df962f590a6f80d3d2747ba9bf87bb669a8624919d770ab1c6be02488", "status": "chad_accepted", "words": "approve"},
