      "profile": "SP-14",
      "question": "A colleague quoted the line pasted below from the troubleshooting page. In the services IFC I opened, a box full of computer code flashes up whenever I edit one particular ventilation fitting. What should I do with that message so the problem can be fixed?",
      "reference": {
        "answer": {
          "support": ["C1.Q1", "C1.Q2", "C1.Q3", "C1.Q4", "C1.Q5", "C1.Q6"],
          "text": "Don't panic: click the Copy Error Message To Clipboard button and paste that text in a bug report. Reporting a bug needs a GitHub account. Along with the error message, describe what you were doing and attach your IFC file or screenshots if relevant. If the issue is particularly complex, you can also chat live with developers or other powerusers."
        },
        "assumptions": ["blender", "bonsai", "model_state"],
        "hazard": null,
        "scope_note": null,
        "steps": [
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q1"],
            "text": "When the error message appears, click the Copy Error Message To Clipboard button."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q3", "C1.Q2"],
            "text": "Report a bug, signing up for a GitHub account if you do not have one, and paste the copied text in the bug report."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q4", "C1.Q5"],
            "text": "Describe what you were doing, and attach your IFC file or screenshots if relevant."
          },
          {
            "support": ["C1.Q6"],
            "text": "If the issue is particularly complex, chat live with developers or other powerusers."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [
          {"display": "Copy Debug Information", "kind": "bonsai_operator", "value": "bim.copy_debug_information"}
        ]
      },
